Server init.
>> a := Blob täze: 4.
a bytes: ( Sanaw täze ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob täze: 4.
b bytes: ( Sanaw täze ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a täze.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Çykyş ýaz: ( a ^ c ), täze-setir. } tut: { :e Çykyş ýaz: e, täze-setir. }, işlet.
a boşat.
b boşat.
